{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼たてまきロールツイン。ぁ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8536046/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久し振りのツイン。しかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たてまきロールという..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがっすか(笑)ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにお口の中にチョコレートがいる。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこ！そこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウザを閉じようとしないで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも 若月です。こんばんわ。雨女らしいよ。わたし。若月です。ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、始まりました若月ブログヽ(゜゜)ノ皆さんいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震は大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。最近、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのが早すぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう７月ですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー、夏だわ。←まんま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いわー...夏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メロンとスイカを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まんまるのまま...食べたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...それは結構無理だから、半分に切ってそれをスプーンで食べたい♪(/ω＼*)うっは！夢膨らむ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに こんなに食べたい欲凄いけど前にダイエットと言っていたので、若月は頑張って少しは痩せましたよ!MAXからは、−４キロ!これを安定させられるようにあと少しだっ!!努力!努力!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もういくつ寝ると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会ですね！あにき!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう 皆さんに会いたい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構開きましたよ期間!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたいよね（つд；*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8536046/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、全国握手会..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだグループとかは出ていませんが、若月ははしゃぎます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに大事な推しがいるのわかっています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでもし良かったら!でいいので若月にも握手来てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、お待ちしております!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ多かった質問への"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ 桜井のファッションはいかがなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗うんとね、悪くはない。私は結構好き。けど、人とは少し感性が違うかなぁーって。リュックに羽が生えてたり、ヒールの高さが尋常じゃなかったり...スタッズの量がおかしかったり...マイケル見たいな服装の女子高生を見かけたら玲香です。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑあれは何の蛇口？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗富士山からの湧き水があそこから出ているんでs......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、マジレスするとあれは洗濯機さんの助手の蛇口さんです。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑサラダ専門店って何!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗サラダの専門店です!!(キリッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。サラダしか売ってないお店なんですが、テンプレのレタスとプラスで具材が好みのものを４つ選べるんです!!で、目の前でお好みのドレッシングとあえてお皿に盛って出してくれるんですよ！超おいしいです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ若月は料理とかするん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗しますとも!!(笑)まぁ、お菓子作りがメインですが...全然料理は作れますわよ！それっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作りガトーショコラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/03/8536046/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"}